   * Commits a job's result. The commit is the moment the record is durable. A
   * repeat with the token that committed returns the stored receipt and writes
   * nothing; any other token is stale. See docs/rfc-007-exactly-once-completion.md.
   */
  complete(id, token, result = null) {
    hit('complete.before-lock', { id });
