edit('docs/leases-and-retries.md', [
  [
    'A worker running a long job calls `heartbeat()`. `JobRunner` does this on a timer, every `leaseMs / 3` by default.',
    'A worker running a long job calls `heartbeat()`. `JobRunner` does this on a timer, every `leaseMs / 3` by default. Each heartbeat is a `heartbeat` record in the log, because the process that reaps expired leases is usually not the one holding them; a heartbeat kept only in the worker would let the reaper take a live worker\'s job. The worker keeps heartbeating until its outcome is recorded.',
  ],
